<title>UK: Skikda port closed by bad weather - shipping agent.</title>
<headline>Skikda port closed by bad weather - shipping agent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Skikda port has closed because of bad weather, a shipping agent said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The port closed late on Tuesday and it was not known when it would reopen, the source said. &quot;Maybe tomorrow.&quot;</p>
<p>No more details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
